Package: tennisage
Type: Package
Title: Generate scatterplot from tennis player career match data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Michelle Chiang
Maintainer: Michelle Chiang <mchiang22@berkeley.edu>
Description: Consists of 2 functions
    The first function gets the career data of a given      player, the second function outputs a scatter plot      with player's age on x-axis, difference between         player's age and opponent's age on y-axis, points       color-coded by win-lose status.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    V8, 
    ggplot2, 
    lubridate,
    stringr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
